  More than English
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The demo also shows Thai, Japanese, Chinese, and Korean. Those are synthetic sample PDFs, and I ran OCR on each one. They aren't scans of real documents.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Japanese and Chinese results had mistakes elsewhere too. The video shows selected excerpts, not a full accuracy test.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The run used local d2md 0.1.3. The PyPI release may differ. If you want to try the released OCR package, install it with:&lt;br&gt;
